cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Lasagna: a compositional framework for RAG component evaluation"
message: >-
  If you use Lasagna in published work, please cite the paper it accompanies
  (preferred-citation below). If you also report a number produced by its
  evaluation harness, please publish the results bundle alongside it: it
  carries the environment, versions, corpus fingerprint and comparability key
  that let a reader tell whether your number and theirs belong in the same
  table.
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: "Ido"
    family-names: "Levy"
    affiliation: "IBM; Weizmann Institute of Science"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0005-7400-3452"
  - given-names: "Segev"
    family-names: "Shlomov"
    affiliation: "IBM"
